<SCRIPT LANGUAGE="JavaScript">
	location.replace("/cgi-bin/@@INSTALL_PREFIX@@/chat.pl");
</SCRIPT>

If you can see this text JavaScript is deactivated in your browser.
You cannot use the chat then. Please activate JavaScript an click
<a href="/cgi-bin/@@INSTALL_PREFIX@@/chat.pl">here</a>.

</body>
</html>
